$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=hollog  LOC_AFTER=?

* The analytic logarithm on a rectangle: a function holomorphic on an open set containing a nested rectangle and zero-free on the rectangle has, on every open subset of the rectangle, a holomorphic logarithm whose derivative is its logarithmic derivative ( Lean ` exists_exp_eq_of_forall_ne_zero ` ).

